# Multi-byte Character Support
# Validates that CalcMark documents with multi-byte UTF-8 content parse correctly

## CJK identifiers as variable names
a = 3
手 = a * 5
給料 = 5000
收入 = 給料 * 12

## Latin extended identifiers
café = 100
naïve = café + 50
résumé = naïve * 2

## Cyrillic identifiers
Москва = 100
доход = Москва + 50

## Emoji identifiers (supported ranges U+1F300-U+1FA6F)
💰 = 1000
🎯 = 💰 + 500
📊 = 💰 * 2

## Mixed multi-byte and ASCII
total = 手 + 給料
combined = café + Москва
everything = 💰 + total

## Multi-byte in markdown headings and prose

她鳥足飽經半方結己平向說眼虎

就明細今士亮上封訴蝸花果但入東手人活扒弟平聽反足們都

Lorem Ipsum คือ เนื้อหาจำลองแบบเรียบๆ ที่ใช้กันในธุรกิจงานพิมพ์

## Calculations after multi-byte prose
x = 42
y = x + 手
